namespace UObjectToolTips

DreamGradientAsset {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamGradientAsset.h#DreamGradientAsset
    src   "A gradient kept as an asset, for a project's shared looks: gold titles, a rarity's colours, a shimmer band. A text's\npaint names one as its Preset (FDreamTextPaint) and paints with its gradient; a rich-text tag names one through a\ncustom style's entry. Editing it repaints nothing: every text painting with it keeps its gradient row, which is written\nagain (OnGradientChanged).\n\nGradients a project would rather keep as text live in the project settings instead (UDreamGUISettings::GradientPresets)."
    text  "作为资源保存的渐变，用于项目共享的外观：金色标题、稀有度配色、微光条带。文本的\n绘制会把其中一个指定为预设(FDreamTextPaint)，并用其渐变绘制；富文本标签则通过\n自定义样式的条目指定其中一个。编辑它不会重绘任何内容：每个用它绘制的文本都会\n保留其渐变行，该行会被重新写入(OnGradientChanged)。\n\n项目更希望以文本形式保留的渐变则存放在项目设置中(UDreamGUISettings::GradientPresets)。"
    state machine
}

DreamGradientAsset:SetGradient {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamGradientAsset.h#DreamGradientAsset:SetGradient
    src   "Replace the gradient, and tell every text painting with it (OnGradientChanged)."
    text  "替换渐变，并通知所有使用该渐变的文本 (OnGradientChanged)。"
    state machine
}

